Package: microbiome
Type: Package
Title: Microbiome Analytics
Description: Provides methods for microbiome data analysis and visualization,
    including compositional transformations, community profiling, diversity
    analysis, and exploration of taxonomic abundance data represented as
    phyloseq objects.
